WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.281 --> 00:00:03.490
- I’m not actually that nervous.

00:00:03.491 --> 00:00:04.408
What?

00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:10.955
- So, I’m gonna be cutting

00:00:10.956 --> 00:00:12.581
Jennifer’s hair today.

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:15.585
- If I went like, snip,
right there a lot would...

00:00:15.586 --> 00:00:18.338
See, already I can see her
getting really angry at me.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.421
- You better not do that.

00:00:19.423 --> 00:00:20.425
- She doesn’t want me to do that.

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:25.845
- [Steven] New Girl look.

00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:27.721
New cut, new girl, new life.

00:00:27.723 --> 00:00:29.265
- [Tyler] Safiya has a lot of hair.

00:00:29.266 --> 00:00:30.308
We’re gonna bring it back.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.935
- I think you’re gonna be surprised.

00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:34.603
- Hopefully, but I do have
a hair appointment scheduled

00:00:34.605 --> 00:00:35.730
just in case.

00:00:35.731 --> 00:00:37.856
(intense music)

00:00:37.858 --> 00:00:41.235
- I feel like I’m constructing
an Ikea set right now.

00:00:41.236 --> 00:00:42.111
(bleep)

00:00:42.113 --> 00:00:43.821
- That means I’m gonna look awful.

00:00:43.823 --> 00:00:45.781
- I feel like I’m on
Project Runway right now.

00:00:45.783 --> 00:00:47.700
- They don’t cut their
hair on Project Runway.

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:48.453
- [Tyler] Okay, nevermind.

00:00:49.786 --> 00:00:51.203
- That felt like a lot.

00:00:51.205 --> 00:00:52.830
(whimpering)
- [Steven] Not good?

00:00:52.831 --> 00:00:54.581
- It’s so short!

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.793
- If you ponytail it and
cut it, I’ll kill you.

00:00:56.795 --> 00:00:58.546
(laughing)

00:00:59.338 --> 00:00:59.923
- Okay.

00:01:02.341 --> 00:01:05.135
- What is that face you just made?

00:01:05.135 --> 00:01:06.386
(giggling)

00:01:08.348 --> 00:01:09.555
- Wait, no.

00:01:09.556 --> 00:01:11.641
Babe it’s gonna look good,
don’t worry about it.

00:01:11.643 --> 00:01:12.808
- [Jennifer] I don’t understand...

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:13.851
(giggling)

00:01:13.853 --> 00:01:15.770
The method that you’re using.

00:01:15.771 --> 00:01:18.273
- I’m sorry, I never went
to haircutting school.

00:01:18.275 --> 00:01:20.733
- I would advise you to look at my front

00:01:20.735 --> 00:01:23.320
and make sure the two sides are the same.

00:01:23.321 --> 00:01:25.196
Like, the same length.
- [Tyler] Okay.

00:01:25.198 --> 00:01:26.530
- And there’s no awkward strands

00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:28.156
like the ones that I’m
feeling and pulling at—

00:01:28.158 --> 00:01:29.366
- [Tyler] Okay, okay!

00:01:29.368 --> 00:01:30.910
- Should I do it all in one?

00:01:30.911 --> 00:01:32.661
Like, all in one swoop?
- [Jennifer] Sure.

00:01:32.663 --> 00:01:34.288
- Is that the right way to do it?

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.123
(giggling)
- No!

00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:36.958
- [Steven] Just like that?

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:38.000
- [Jennifer] You go below, yeah.

00:01:38.001 --> 00:01:39.420
- [Steven] Like this?
- [Jennifer] Sure.

00:01:46.051 --> 00:01:46.926
(bleep)

00:01:46.928 --> 00:01:48.093
- Hang on one second.

00:01:48.095 --> 00:01:49.428
- [Steven] I just cut myself, there.

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:50.930
- Oh my god, wait, we’re good!

00:01:50.931 --> 00:01:53.223
We’re good! It’s so short!

00:01:53.225 --> 00:01:54.391
- [Steven] Wait, stop.
- [Jennifer] Do I look

00:01:54.393 --> 00:01:55.143
horrible?
- [Steven] No, I think it

00:01:55.145 --> 00:01:56.520
looks, I think it looks cute.

00:01:58.856 --> 00:02:00.398
- [Safiya] Yeah?
- [Tyler] Yeah.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.233
- Is it good?

00:02:02.943 --> 00:02:03.943
Maybe?

00:02:03.945 --> 00:02:05.195
- I think this is pretty good!

00:02:05.196 --> 00:02:06.028
- Okay?

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.321
- It may not be even everywhere.

00:02:07.323 --> 00:02:08.991
(laughter)

00:02:11.576 --> 00:02:13.243
- Alright...

00:02:13.245 --> 00:02:16.415
(laughing)
Oh my god!

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:18.418
- No good?

00:02:22.421 --> 00:02:23.796
- It doesn’t look bad, actually.

00:02:23.798 --> 00:02:25.340
It looks pretty good.
- [Tyler] Right?

00:02:25.341 --> 00:02:27.633
- It doesn’t look like
Jennifer Aniston at all.

00:02:27.635 --> 00:02:30.970
- I look like one of
those scary monster dolls

00:02:30.971 --> 00:02:32.930
that you find at Toys R Us.

00:02:32.931 --> 00:02:35.850
- It looks like a trim.

00:02:35.851 --> 00:02:37.060
- [Tyler] Yeah!
- [Safiya] Kind of.

00:02:37.061 --> 00:02:38.101
- Your hair’s just a little shorter.

00:02:38.103 --> 00:02:39.686
- I think it’s a good
look, I like the bang look.

00:02:39.688 --> 00:02:42.148
It’s a banging set of bangs
you got going on there.

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:43.023
- See, cause look at this.

00:02:43.025 --> 00:02:44.858
It’s like in, and down.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.863
That’s really the problem.

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:51.370
(playful music)

00:02:54.703 --> 00:02:57.663
- I thought it would be worse, I mean...

00:02:57.665 --> 00:02:58.790
I can live with it.

00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:00.458
- See? Not terrible.

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:01.458
That’s all I was going for.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.918
- You look cute.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.170
- I know.

00:03:04.171 --> 00:03:05.796
- Yikes.
(smooches)

00:03:05.798 --> 00:03:07.715
- You need trust for something like this.

00:03:07.716 --> 00:03:09.591
Um, I definitely have a
little bit more respect

00:03:09.593 --> 00:03:11.551
for hairstylists.

00:03:11.553 --> 00:03:12.471
- Me too.

00:03:16.976 --> 00:03:18.183
- [Steven] She’s still pretty cute.

00:03:18.185 --> 00:03:19.645
- [Jennifer] Thanks.

00:03:20.563 --> 00:03:22.065
- [Steven] You’ve got hair
all over you by the way.

